{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114093","id":3107955028,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc65P6FU","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114093","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114093.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114093.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114093","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114093/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114093/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114093/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/41d32144f5cc1e66e601903ac2fab5c05c4dc2e1","number":114093,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Add AABB built-in for Godot shaders","user":{"login":"celyk","id":50609684,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNjA5Njg0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50609684?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/celyk","html_url":"https://github.com/celyk","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/celyk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/celyk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/celyk/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/celyk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/celyk/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/celyk/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/celyk/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/celyk/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/celyk/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Part of implementing my [proposal](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/13875). Repurposing the mesh compression AABB allows it to work for all meshes. Note that this gives the bounds of the current surface rather than the mesh as a whole, but it’s still a win for shader programmers.\r\n\r\n\u2028\u2028The sign bit of size.x in the shader determines if compression is enabled, which assumes that the AABB size should be positive. This means that to decode the size we do abs(size), which is already encapsulated by AABB_SIZE. It's an implementation detail and not something the user has to think about.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e4b69a73-9240-4968-bb31-c26d5c447d4d\r\n\r\nI have tested the AABB on each renderer, with compressed and uncompressed meshes, and with MultiMeshInstance3D.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"677\" height=\"546\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-12-16 at 4 20 15 pm\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/39a5fa14-da6a-42ab-912a-8ace5a4164ca\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n[AABB-test-project.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/24200953/AABB-test-project.zip)\r\n\r\n\u2028Here’s a small test shader that is included with the project\r\n```glsl\r\nshader_type spatial;\r\n\r\nrender_mode unshaded;\r\nrender_mode cull_disabled;\r\n\r\nvoid vertex() {\r\n\tvec3 normalized_vertex = (VERTEX - AABB_POS) / AABB_SIZE;\r\n\tCOLOR.rgb = normalized_vertex;\r\n}\r\n\r\nvoid fragment() {\r\n\tALBEDO = COLOR.rgb;\r\n}\r\n```\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1609442062,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNjA5NDQyMDYy","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:shaders","name":"topic:shaders","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":5796,"closed_issues":0,"created_at":"2022-07-26T12:42:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T09:35:07Z","closed_at":null,"due_on":null},"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-12-16T22:35:44Z","updated_at":"2026-02-17T20:09:57Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_r